Comment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去確認一下
Comment: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,指定時間已經超過了三分鐘
Comment: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡是地點A
Comment: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並沒有相符的人物
Comment: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼回事 逃走了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來對方只是虛張聲勢啊
Comment: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有這回事喔
Comment: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 剛剛那個人聲是怎麼回事?
Comment: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不是好好地來了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就在你旁邊
Comment: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 聽得見嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,交易中止 中止了!
Comment: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你們也趕快撤退...
Comment: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...妳是...
Comment: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...妳這混帳
Comment: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸 又來啊?
Comment: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以是可以 那麼 委託方是?
Comment: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,製藥公司?
Comment: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這不是我們的管轄範圍吧?
Comment: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:24.01,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然是這樣...
Comment: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 泳衣這種東西 結果就是要穿給別人看的嘛...
Comment: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是去沒有任何旁人的私人游泳池就沒意義了啊
Comment: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 市民游泳池和海水浴場超擠的
Comment: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能游泳的空間不就超少的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗯...結果妳說的也沒有錯啦...
Comment: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瀧壺 妳覺得呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要有空間讓我漂浮 哪邊都可以啊
Comment: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好了 工作中不要哈拉
Comment: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,絹旗也可以停手了
Comment: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有新的委託進來 回去吧
Comment: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼時候?
Comment: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道 委託的內容不太明確呢
Comment: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要做的事情倒是很簡單啊
Comment: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,蛤? 什麼跟什麼 不懂妳的意思
Comment: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過如果麥野覺得可以就好啦
Comment: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要做的事情是?
Comment: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對抗謎之侵略者的設施防衛戰!
Comment: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,報酬也不錯
Comment: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:33.98,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(700,980)}Item
Comment: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以我們道具的工作而言 不是挺好的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.26,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:09.43,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,操縱電力的能力者啊...
Comment: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從對方使用通信線路進行的恐怖攻擊
Comment: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以及可以躲過電子類的保全系統這兩點
Comment: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所做出的推測
Comment: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼說來 委託人似乎已經鎖定犯人是誰了呢
Comment: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然鎖定了目標
Comment: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼不從我們這邊發動超主動襲擊?
Comment: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣出其不意的襲擊不是超容易獲勝的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「只有目標侵入設施時才出手 不要追究其身分」
Comment: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是委託人的要求
Comment: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,蛤? 這算什麼?
Comment: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果還是不清不楚嘛
Comment: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼啦!
Comment: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也不是因為想做才接這委託的
Comment: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且
Comment: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像這類的委託
Comment: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對方一定有很多隱情
Comment: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要再囉囉嗦嗦了 快給我去工作!
Comment: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是
Comment: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們要做的事情
Comment: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有埋伏並解決掉敵人而已嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然是這樣
Comment: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩的是
Comment: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被盯上的設施可能有兩處呢...
Comment: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我!
Comment: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,其中一處我一個人去!
Comment: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸?
Comment: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼?
Comment: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳剛剛明明超不滿的樣子
Comment: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是兩回事
Comment: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果一個人打倒目標的話
Comment: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果就能得到一半的酬勞對吧?
Comment: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是一定要聯絡我們
Comment: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要一個人搶先啊
Comment: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,包括這裡
Comment: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有兩個地方
Comment: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗究竟是以怎樣的速率在進行
Comment: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我完全不想調查
Comment: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就在今晚
Comment: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要讓這一切結束!
Comment: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然被高額的報酬吸引而來
Comment: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一個不知道會不會來的人
Comment: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的很無聊啊...
Comment: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且
Comment: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果她去了另外一處
Comment: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而我卻在這無聊的苦等
Comment: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼都沒做就結束的可能性也...
Comment: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會吧!
Comment: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來了來了來了!
Comment: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是因為我平時有做善事燒好香啊
Comment: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好
Comment: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目標研究設施在最頂層嗎...
Comment: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是能這樣順利的結束就好了...
Comment: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然
Comment: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有那麼簡單的事啊
Comment: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,連一片瓦礫都沒打中?
Comment: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,使用磁力讓墜落物的軌道偏移嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來敵方是發電系能力者的情報沒有錯呢
Comment: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好了 ~
Comment: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這原本是用來燒毀門板或牆壁的工具...
Comment: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,炸彈?
Comment: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這人幹什麼...
Comment: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喜歡把炸彈裝進洋娃娃裡面!?
Comment: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,利用事先佈置在房間內的導火線引爆嗎?
Comment: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:07:50.39,0:07:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對方到底在想什麼...用這種炫耀的方式...
Comment: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什...
Comment: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,瓦礫裡有炸彈!?
Comment: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,行動被對方看穿了
Comment: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:03.89,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1215,980)}Electro Master
Comment: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說對方知道我是電擊能力者了!?
Comment: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,將磁力發揮到最強的緊急迴避
Comment: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為對自身傷害也很大 原本不想使用的...
Comment: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比起這個...
Comment: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,敵人呢?
Comment: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這種地方竟然也有...
Comment: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沿著導火線到另一端
Comment: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這傢伙嗎!?
Comment: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽說出現在病理解析研究所那邊
Comment: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去了那邊啊
Comment: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這邊也加快速度移送吧
Comment: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打擾一下
Comment: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有客人來了...
Comment: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不好意思 讓妳久等了
Comment: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初次見面
Comment: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...妳是...?
Comment: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:26.05,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1053,980)}Testament
Comment: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是擔任貴公司的「學習裝置」監修的布束
Comment: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被鋼筋擋住了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,之後再被妨礙也很麻煩
Comment: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先解決掉妳!
Comment: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打得真誇張啊
Comment: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是用平常的遙控式炸彈的話 早就幹掉她了
Comment: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.87,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1269,980)}Electro Master
Comment: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過對手是這種水平的電擊能力者
Comment: 0,0:09:48.01,0:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,遙控可能會反過來被她支配啊
Comment: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果我還是選對了嗎...
Comment: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但...是...
Comment: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,騙人!
Comment: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,連陶器炸彈也不怕!?
Comment: 0,0:10:05.09,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她跟以往那些能力者的等級完全不同的樣子啊...
Comment: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,別想逃
Comment: 0,0:10:14.77,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管是事件的直接關係人還是受僱者
Comment: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,參與幫助實驗的傢伙...
Comment: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都無法原諒!
Comment: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇 好嚇人的表情啊
Comment: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕了 被抓到的話可能會被大卸八塊啊
Comment: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開玩笑的啦~~~
Comment: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我引誘的很緊繃啊
Comment: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡還挺高的喔
Comment: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話就算是上位的能力者...也...?
Comment: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該...
Comment: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,該不會...
Comment: 0,0:11:04.95,0:11:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果想讓我摔下去
Comment: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就得把鐵全部去除
Comment: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,將整個設施重建一遍才行啊
Comment: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼嘛 好狡猾!
Comment: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 慘了!
Comment: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是死路呢
Comment: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒想到我竟然會被逼到這種地步啊
Comment: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳犯了個非常簡單的錯誤啊
Comment: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是因為慌張所以判斷錯誤嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是...
Comment: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哼
Comment: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳覺得呢~~~?
Comment: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.98,ADT,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:59.94,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:58.31,0:12:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不好意思 雖然沒有什麼特別需要妳幫忙的事情...
Comment: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但畢竟我們也是第一次進行這麼大規模的移送...
Comment: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此
Comment: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.40,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(900,980)}Radio Noise
Comment: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,想請超電磁砲量產計畫的相關人員
Comment: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,布束博士在這裡待命以防萬一...
Comment: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常感謝
Comment: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請您在這裡稍等一下
Comment: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想趁現在問妳一件事
Comment: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雇用妳們的人是誰?
Comment: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,奉勸妳最好不要顧慮什麼職場道義喔
Comment: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個設施是那個瘋狂實驗的...
Comment: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊~~~別說了 這些無所謂的事情
Comment: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雇主的目的 要消滅的對象是善是惡
Comment: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有那個對象一路走來的人生之類的
Comment: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果 這些事對我而言...
Comment: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,根本怎樣都無所謂啊
Comment: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳還搞不清楚情況嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,追擊的那方反而被逼到走投無路 這種事情也是常有的
Comment: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看看妳的腳邊吧
Comment: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,退路被堵死
Comment: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也沒有保護身體的護盾
Comment: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種困境
Comment: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能突破 妳就試試看啊
Comment: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真傷腦筋啊
Comment: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是因為想和妳談談才會變成這樣!
Comment: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明應該多保留一些體力
Comment: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用磁力將地板抬起切斷!?
Comment: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,慘了
Comment: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙是Level 5級的能力者...!
Comment: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,做好覺悟了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 這種過強的力量反而會讓妳大意啊!
Comment: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕...
Comment: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是因為妳莽撞的衝過來才會變成這樣喔
Comment: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,震撼彈嗎...
Comment: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太大意了!
Comment: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,耳朵和眼睛都...
Comment: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓自信滿滿的能力者陷入絕境的這一瞬間...
Comment: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是絕妙的快感啊!
Comment: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果只要我出馬 就能輕鬆搞定呢
Comment: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太棒了 可以得到一半的酬勞了
Comment: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要用來買什麼呢~~~
Comment: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,半額的酬勞~ 半額的酬勞~
Comment: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的 到底要買什麼好...呢...
Comment: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不見了!?
Comment: 0,0:14:50.83,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,火力並沒有強到足以把人炸到屍骨無存
Comment: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...也就是說 結果...
Comment: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:02.07,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(992,980)}Electro Master
Comment: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然妳似乎針對電擊能力者做了很多調查
Comment: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 到了我這種程度
Comment: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就能使用電磁波掌握空間了喔
Comment: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哎呀
Comment: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,奉勸妳不要輕舉妄動喔
Comment: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的眼睛也差不多快能看清楚了
Comment: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種距離 不管怎樣都是電擊比較快
Comment: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Miji...
Comment: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Miji cavi capri citreva sgichovire
Comment: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在說什麼...?
Comment: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:28.07,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sgicacci slano
Comment: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既不是英文 也不是法文...
Comment: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.19,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,happa fumifumi
Comment: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦...可是剛剛明明是說日文...
Comment: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才沒有這種語言啦!
Comment: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,毒藥?
Comment: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還在掙扎嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...
Comment: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市特製的氣體炸藥
Comment: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「伊格尼斯」
Comment: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然吸進這種氣體也對人體無害
Comment: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是剛才那一小瓶就擁有這樣的威力
Comment: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是說 現在這間房間就是顆巨大的炸彈喔
Comment: 0,0:15:59.18,0:15:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果
Comment: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,使用電力的話會怎麼樣呢?
Comment: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓我慢慢地折磨妳吧
Comment: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不妙
Comment: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電力理所當然不能使用
Comment: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用磁力操縱建材所產生的摩擦也會造成危險...
Comment: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼回事啊 這傢伙
Comment: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明光是踩踏的衝擊就足以引發火花啊
Comment: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳的表情像是看到想要自殺的人呢
Comment: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我可是在暗部工作啊
Comment: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是貪生怕死的話怎麼工作啊!
Comment: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,騙妳的啦~
Comment: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼可能有這種事
Comment: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我可不想和妳一起死呢
Comment: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一開始丟出去的確實是真正的炸藥
Comment: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,之後散佈的不過就是氮氣瓦斯而已
Comment: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒想到居然這麼輕易就上當了啊
Comment: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,正在待命的暗部清除者怎麼樣了?
Comment: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒什麼異常
Comment: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒想到都是些乳臭未乾的小女生
Comment: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比起這個
Comment: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道那邊情況如何了...
Comment: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不知道
Comment: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,經由外部的確認方式已經全部切斷了
Comment: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這邊只負責盡快移送而已
Comment: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 如果有什麼萬一...
Comment: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了以防萬一
Comment: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才找來了那時承擔責任的代罪羔羊啊
Comment: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,久等了 布束博士...
Comment: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,咦?
Comment: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,去廁所了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.61,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(723,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,調整中的妹妹們的移送應該是最後階段了...
Comment: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然的計畫延續以及對襲擊者的警戒
Comment: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,導致內部的警備較為鬆懈
Comment: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要執行「那個」
Comment: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只能趁現在了!
Comment: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳還真是拚命啊
Comment: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 如果不快點結束
Comment: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麥野她們就要來了呢
Comment: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然我剛剛說過對象的人生怎樣都無所謂
Comment: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是在這種要下殺手的時候
Comment: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是會有點感慨啊
Comment: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,奪取對方性命的...那個瞬間
Comment: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像是我在支配對方的命運
Comment: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這傢伙之所以出生 就是為了被我殺掉啊!
Comment: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓我聽聽妳死前最悅耳動聽的悲鳴吧!
Comment: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什...
Comment: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了被殺死...
Comment: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才生於這個世界?
Comment: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於這種愚蠢至極的命運
Comment: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既不逃走也不抵抗
Comment: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,甚至連求救都不會
Comment: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,像是理所當然似的接受...
Comment: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開什麼玩笑啊!
Comment: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用勒的?
Comment: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此...
Comment: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話就可以沒有任何衝擊的將對方殺死...
Comment: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,慘了!
Comment: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這點子雖然不錯
Comment: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但不過就是...
Comment: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好痛痛痛痛...
Comment: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好險好險
Comment: 0,0:19:56.28,0:20:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,下半身竟然差一點就被自己設的陷阱炸掉...
Comment: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我最自傲的美腿啊...
Comment: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊 原來如此啊
Comment: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果
Comment: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我竟然被妳小兒科似的虛張聲勢給騙了啊
Comment: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是...
Comment: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我竟然說「結果」
Comment: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被妳的口頭禪傳染了呢
Comment: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電擊之所以手下留情
Comment: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並不是因為殺了妳會讓我不安喔
Comment: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把妳所知道跟計畫相關的所有情報全給我吐出來
Comment: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,主導計畫的首腦是誰?
Comment: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雇用妳們的人是誰?
Comment: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不...其實我們之間還夾著一個仲介人...
Comment: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說到這個
Comment: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳剛剛說過有人要來吧?
Comment: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是誰?
Comment: 0,0:20:56.95,0:20:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種事情我怎麼可能跟妳說...
Comment: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果不想變成焦屍
Comment: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就給我在三秒內回答
Comment: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,3
Comment: 0,0:21:10.17,0:21:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇哇 我說 我說 我說啦
Comment: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,2
Comment: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,舌...舌頭
Comment: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為剛才的電擊...
Comment: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等! 舌頭麻掉了說不出話啊
Comment: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說不出來啊 所以我說...
Comment: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,1
Comment: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,0
Comment: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不願意出賣夥伴
Comment: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是...
Comment: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是那樣 是舌頭被電麻了...
Comment: 0,0:21:36.41,0:21:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然我並不討厭這種義氣...
Comment: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由於太過安靜了
Comment: 0,0:21:50.73,0:21:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還以為妳已經被徹底收拾乾淨了
Comment: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來真是千鈞一髮啊
Comment: 0,0:21:58.29,0:21:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,芙蘭達
Comment: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:01.33,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.26,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂美琴
Comment: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要摧毀計畫!
Comment: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不可能讓她一個人戰鬥!
Comment: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要解救她們!
Comment: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯 我也加入
Comment: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,盡我所能...
Comment: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:48.02,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:45.01,0:23:47.01,staff,export,0,0,0,,
